":{"year":2025,"value":0.74,"numerator":4475,"denominator":6009169,"sources":["unhcr-pop-2026","wb-pop-2026"],"note":"Refugees per 1,000 people living in Denmark."}},"headlines":{"over_time":{"text":"Eritrean refugees in Denmark rose from {n0} (1999) to {n1} (2023), then fell to {n2} (2025)","nums":[25,6033,4475],"years":[1999,2023,2025]},"where_people_are":{"text":"Denmark hosts {p0} of all Eritrean refugees (2025), up from {p1} in 2013","pcts":[0.8,0.0],"years":[2025,2013]}},"steps":{"brief":true,"key_numbers":true,"over_time":true,"where_people_are":true,"inside_outside":true,"compare":false,"context":true,"other_angles":true,"limitations":true,"sources":true},"brief_sources":[],"footnotes":{"fn_487f7c7c":"Since 2024, the number of refugees in Denmark are based on data reported by authorities of persons with valid residence permits for asylum provided by Statistics Denmark as well as temporary protection holders provided by the Danish Immigration Service.","fn_a983ed4d":"The decrease in the stateless population in Denmark between 2022 and 2023 is due to de-duplication of figures reported in previous years.","fn_e66e3ad6":"With regards to refugee statistics, since 2024 the number of refugees is Denmark are based on data reported by authorities of persons with valid residence permits for asylum as of 1 January 2024 and increases (e.g. recognitions) or decreases (e.g. refugee status cessation) through the year are as reported by authorities. Figures for temporary protection holders in Denmark are based on data by Eurostat. The figures replace previous refugee stock estimations conducted by UNHCR.","fn_f4073f35":"With regards to stateless statistics, the figures include: (a) the number of stateless asylum seekers at end-year reported by the Danish authorities; (b) the number of stateless refugees at year-end with valid residence permit as of 1 January 2024 and increases (e.g. recognitions) or decreases (e.g. refugee status cessation) through the year as reported by Danish authorities; and (c) the number of non-displaced stateless persons (those with other non-protection related types of permits) based on data from Statistics Denmark corresponding to the resident population recorded as \"Stateless\" as of 1 January 2025, deducting the estimated number of stateless refugees at year-end.","fn_f6100d39":"With regards to stateless statistics, the figures include: (a) the number of stateless asylum seekers at year-end reported by the Danish authorities; (b) the number of stateless refugees by year-end (including temporary protection holders) with valid residence permit as reported by Danish authorities; and (c) the number of non-displaced stateless persons (those with other non-protection related types of permits) based on data from Statistics Denmark corresponding to the resident population recorded as \"Stateless\" as of 1 January 2026, deducting the estimated number of stateless refugees at year-end."},"raw_files":{"conflict.csv":{"label":"IDMC GIDD, conflict and violence (HDX csv)","header":["iso3","country_name","year","new_displacement","new_displacement_rounded","total_displacement","total_displacement_rounded"]},"demographics/2025.zip":{"label":"UNHCR API download (demographics/2025.zip)","header":["Year","Country of origin","Country of origin (ISO)","Country of asylum","Country of asylum (ISO)","Population Type","Female 0 - 4","Female 5 - 11","Female 12 - 17","Female 18 - 59","Female 60","Female other","Female total","Male 0 - 4","Male 5 - 11","Male 12 - 17","Male 18 - 59","Male 60","Male other","Male total","Total"]},"persons_of_concern.csv":{"label":"UNHCR Refugee Data Finder download (persons_of_concern.csv)","header":["Year","Country of Asylum","Country of Origin","Country of Asylum ISO","Country of Origin ISO","Refugees","Asylum-seekers","IDPs","Other people in need of international protection","Stateless persons","Host community","Others of concern"]}},"raw_rows":{"conflict.csv#L126":{"file_key":"conflict.csv","line":1